{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated human-readable labels for atlas-v1-lite L1 (subject-area) regions,",
    "re-keyed for the 1.2 refit in the quantised coordinate system. K-means",
    "renumbers clusters under a perturbed encoder, so the 2026-08 curation was",
    "carried across by optimal centroid matching (Hungarian on cosine, verified",
    "against each region's tf-idf terms); the eight regions the refit genuinely",
    "reorganised were re-curated from fresh reservoir samples of their member",
    "records, following the original rules below.",
    "",
    "Declarative curation: the build re-applies these on every rebuild; they are",
    "never silent edits to centroids. Keys are L1 cell ids as strings; values are",
    "report names.",
    "",
    "Each name was written against that region's distinctive terms, its axis and",
    "language mix, and a reservoir sample of member records assigned via nearest",
    "fine-cell parent. Subject names only: after per-language centering,",
    "language is not what separates these regions."
  ],
